  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australian Water Partnership for the Indo-Pacific Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australian Water Partnership (AWP) Phase 3 aims to enhance climate-resilient water resource management in the Indo-Pacific. AWP Phase 3 links Australian expertise with regional partners to co-create policies, practices and tools, and build capacity and partnerships for climate-resilient water management.</narrative>
  </description>
